  72+ 0000              ;Version 2.1
  73+ 0000              ;Version 2.2 adding CIPSEND/IPD and some ANSI support etc
  74+ 0000              ;2.2 a minor patch aborted speed tester for prescaler
  75+ 0000              ;2.2 b change to use dual write to BAUD RATE for full scalar access and correct credits.
  76+ 0000              ;2.2 c correct available speeds to match some of the minicom ones on a Linux box
  77+ 0000              ;2.2 d added ability to send EOT (to support 4G modem card)
  78+ 0000              ;2.2 e added find ESP mode that tries all PreScaler values
  79+ 0000
